<div class="data-deletion">
    <h1>Memes Planet - Data Deletion Instructions</h1>
    <p class="text-muted">Last updated: December 21, 2024</p>

    <div class="notice">
        <p>At Memes Planet (memesplanet.com), we respect your privacy and data rights. This page explains how to request deletion of your personal data from our platform.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="my-4">
        <h2>Types of Data We Store</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>Account information (email, username)</li>
            <li>User-generated content (uploaded memes, comments)</li>
            <li>Usage data and preferences</li>
            <li>Collection and tag information</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="my-4">
        <h2>Data Deletion Process</h2>
        
        <div class="step">
            <h3><span class="step-number">1</span>Account Deletion Request</h3>
            <p>To initiate the data deletion process:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Log into your account at memesplanet.com</li>
                <li>Go to Account Settings</li>
                <li>Click on "Delete Account"</li>
                <li>Confirm your decision</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="step">
            <h3><span class="step-number">2</span>Email Request</h3>
            <p>Alternatively, you can email us at privacy@memesplanet.com with:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Subject line: "Data Deletion Request"</li>
                <li>Your registered email address</li>
                <li>Username (if applicable)</li>
                <li>Brief reason for deletion (optional)</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="step">
            <h3><span class="step-number">3</span>Verification Process</h3>
            <p>For security, we will:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Verify your identity</li>
                <li>Send a confirmation email</li>
                <li>Request additional information if needed</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="step">
            <h3><span class="step-number">4</span>Deletion Confirmation</h3>
            <p>Once verified:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>We will process your request within 30 days</li>
                <li>Send a confirmation email when completed</li>
                <li>Provide a deletion certificate if requested</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="my-4">
        <h2>What Gets Deleted</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>All personal information</li>
            <li>User-generated content</li>
            <li>Account preferences and settings</li>
            <li>Usage history and logs</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="my-4">
        <h2>Data Retention</h2>
        <p>Some information may be retained:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Legal compliance records (as required by law)</li>
            <li>Aggregate analytics (non-personal data)</li>
            <li>Public content shared by other users</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="my-4">
        <h2>Additional Information</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>Deletion process is permanent and cannot be undone</li>
            <li>Downloaded content should be saved before account deletion</li>
            <li>Third-party shares cannot be automatically deleted</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="my-4">
        <h2>Contact Us</h2>
        <p>For questions about data deletion, contact us at:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Email: privacy@memesplanet.com</li>
            <li>Website: https://memesplanet.com</li>
            <li>Address: [Your Business Address]</li>
        </ul>
    </div>
</div>
